[    0.771553] (0)[1:swapper/0][Dumchar_probe]There are 3 address in eMMC Project: Linear Address, Logical Address, Physical Address
[    0.771564] (0)[1:swapper/0][Dumchar_probe]Linear Address: Used in scatter file, uboot, preloader,flash tool etc. 
[    0.771575] (0)[1:swapper/0][Dumchar_probe]Linear Address: MBR linear address is fixed in eMMCComo.mk, that is same for all chips in the project 
[    0.771585] (0)[1:swapper/0][Dumchar_probe]Logical Address: Used in /proc/dumchar_info, mmcblk0 etc. MBR logical address is 0
[    0.771596] (0)[1:swapper/0][Dumchar_probe]Physical Address: Used in eMMC driver, MBR Physical Address = MBR Linear Address - (BOOT1 size + BOOT2 Size + RPMB Size)
